WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
You can only use the missing skill once on Fangyeol.

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,280
I will face her in the future

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:06,820
Then you can no longer use God's throne

4
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,900
Fanglie sent someone to come in

5
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,860
