6
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:11,780
Traveling in and out of Kyoto

7
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,660
I haven’t invited you to see Your Excellency Fangyeol yet, so I’m so abrupt.

8
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,620
God's seat is serious

9
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:17,580
Fang Shuai said it doesn’t matter if we don’t have to meet each other, he has nothing to say to you, idiot

10
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,820
There is no need to tell the truth

11
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,980
My commander sent us over to ask a question

12
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,900
Who just punched Hua Doudou?

13
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,820
This is Fang Shuai's gift to the throne

14
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,780
