22
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:41,100
It’s time for Japan to come to your home in person to absolve himself of his crimes. That’s not okay. The commander-in-chief said so.

23
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,060
Now that we are on our way, we are so busy

24
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,180
Then you have to drain your blood

25
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:45,020
