26
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,260
It can also be stained with the blood of both of us.

27
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:48,100
Xia Guo and Shentang have been on good terms for generations

28
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,940
